                  "value": "These files consist of data and Matlab code needed to reproduce the main figures of \"Rapid switching of vestibulo-motor pathways through voluntary eyelid closure in primates\". Data and results include eye movement responses during experiments where participants opened and closed their eyes. Data are provided in .mat matlab files (to run with source code)."
